<title>AUSTRIA: Austria May jobless rate steady at 4.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria May jobless rate steady at 4.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 May 97   April 97   May 96</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	4.4	4.4	  4.1</p>
<p> Total			    210,993  236,327    207,879</p>
<p>NOTE - The May 1997 figure is an extrapolation by the Austrian Labour Market Service from final, seasonally adjusted Eurostat data for March.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
